WEBVTT

00:35:56.861 --> 00:36:00.883
"I will feel whatever I need to feel
to not fall into depression."

00:36:00.907 --> 00:36:02.264
And that includes grief.

00:36:02.288 --> 00:36:04.908
I will feel sorrow. I will feel rage.

00:36:04.932 --> 00:36:06.318
I will feel pain.

00:36:06.342 --> 00:36:08.518
Because depression
is the absence of feeling.

00:36:08.542 --> 00:36:12.600
It's this sense that I cannot feel,
this is too painful, it's too horrible,

00:36:12.624 --> 00:36:14.332
and so I'm going to shut down.

00:36:14.356 --> 00:36:15.944
And I won't. And I didn't.

00:36:15.968 --> 00:36:18.138
I didn't shut down
all through Rayya's death,

00:36:18.162 --> 00:36:20.799
and I didn't shut down after,
and I'm not shut down now.

00:36:20.823 --> 00:36:24.792
So I want access to
the whole palette of human emotion.

00:36:24.816 --> 00:36:30.260
I'm willing to be in all of it,
at the same time, often.